(6693480, 1001017, 134859, '<td valign="top">There are many different movies titled "Stalker".  So I am not sure which one you are talking about here.  However, I must say, it does have a "stalkerish" feeling here.  I think that if it wasn''t so overexposed, perhaps if you went the other route and underexposed it, it would portray the concept better?  I am not sure.  But, it does have an eerie feeling to it.</td>', 'There are many different movies titled "Stalker".  So I am not sure which one you are talking about here.  However, I must say, it does have a "stalkerish" feeling here.  I think that if it wasn''t so overexposed, perhaps if you went the other route and underexposed it, it would portray the concept better?  I am not sure.  But, it does have an eerie feeling to it.', '2012-02-27 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693483, 1000915, 134859, '<td valign="top">Never heard of the movie until now.  Looked it up, and it sounds wonderful.  I will have to watch it.  I do like that you have chosen this for your picture.  There is "separation" here.  I wonder how many people will say DNMC because of your image choice?  <br/>I think it''s great.  I like everything about it.  It''s simplistic.  The colors play well off of one another.  The sharpness is just the right amount and shoes great detail.  <br/>The only thing I think you should have done differently would be to clone out the white specks that are against the black background.  <br/>Overall, this is a wonderful image!</td>', 'Never heard of the movie until now.  Looked it up, and it sounds wonderful.  I will have to watch it.  I do like that you have chosen this for your picture.  There is "separation" here.  I wonder how many people will say DNMC because of your image choice?  I think it''s great.  I like everything about it.  It''s simplistic.  The colors play well off of one another.  The sharpness is just the right amount and shoes great detail.  The only thing I think you should have done differently would be to clone out the white specks that are against the black background.  Overall, this is a wonderful image!', '2012-02-27 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
