(6693537, 1001116, 134859, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this!  When Harry Met Sally is one of my favorite movies.  I had never seen it until about a year ago, when my husband and I watched it together.  From that point on, I have watched it numerous times.  I think you captured the moment here.  The colors work well, I especially like the blue and orange contrasting against one another.  The beach looks like it could be a stormy day, which gives a different feeling than if it were to be sunny with cloud cover.  It''s a more intimate moment here.  One of my faves!  9</td>', 'I LOVE this!  When Harry Met Sally is one of my favorite movies.  I had never seen it until about a year ago, when my husband and I watched it together.  From that point on, I have watched it numerous times.  I think you captured the moment here.  The colors work well, I especially like the blue and orange contrasting against one another.  The beach looks like it could be a stormy day, which gives a different feeling than if it were to be sunny with cloud cover.  It''s a more intimate moment here.  One of my faves!  9', '2012-02-27 15:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
