(6693601, 1000897, 143245, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2012-02-27 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693616, 1000892, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I would have liked to have seen a little more vibrance in the colors, but other than that, I think you have nice DOF and a good composition.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I would have liked to have seen a little more vibrance in the colors, but other than that, I think you have nice DOF and a good composition.', '2012-02-27 16:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693618, 1000930, 134859, '<td valign="top">It looks like this would be a halloween picture, but because of the dates required for the challenge, I know it''s not.  So the fact that there was a kid dressed like this is different (unless it was set up this way).  <br/>I like the black and white.  There is a bit of graininess that is intriguing, the blurred background plays well with the foreground.</td>', 'It looks like this would be a halloween picture, but because of the dates required for the challenge, I know it''s not.  So the fact that there was a kid dressed like this is different (unless it was set up this way).  I like the black and white.  There is a bit of graininess that is intriguing, the blurred background plays well with the foreground.', '2012-02-27 17:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693621, 1001041, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s different.  Wish the guy on the barstool was out of focus, or cropped out when the picture was taken.  Overall, it''s a good picture, but I think with minor adjustments, it would have been much better</td>', 'It''s different.  Wish the guy on the barstool was out of focus, or cropped out when the picture was taken.  Overall, it''s a good picture, but I think with minor adjustments, it would have been much better', '2012-02-27 17:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693624, 1000833, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the color scheme here.  The boy on the clock should have been more focused, in  my opinion.  Other than that, great picture</td>', 'I like the color scheme here.  The boy on the clock should have been more focused, in  my opinion.  Other than that, great picture', '2012-02-27 17:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693625, 1001102, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love the black and white conversion!  It''s a telling picture.  Makes me remember exactly why I cannot stand big cities!  lol.<br/>Good portrayal.</td>', 'I love the black and white conversion!  It''s a telling picture.  Makes me remember exactly why I cannot stand big cities!  lol.Good portrayal.', '2012-02-27 17:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693627, 1000740, 134859, '<td valign="top">The bird looks a little strange, as his one wing looks much shorter than the other because of the angle shot.  I would have liked to have seen a little more sharpness/detail.  Fits the title well, however.  :)</td>', 'The bird looks a little strange, as his one wing looks much shorter than the other because of the angle shot.  I would have liked to have seen a little more sharpness/detail.  Fits the title well, however.  :)', '2012-02-27 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693628, 1001038, 134859, '<td valign="top">I think the concept here was good, just don''t think the photo actually does it justice.  The look on the guys face is a little odd, and the female looks forced.  The lighting isn''t doing the picture justice either, in my opinion.  Great concept, just don''t think it was quite captured.</td>', 'I think the concept here was good, just don''t think the photo actually does it justice.  The look on the guys face is a little odd, and the female looks forced.  The lighting isn''t doing the picture justice either, in my opinion.  Great concept, just don''t think it was quite captured.', '2012-02-27 17:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693630, 1000470, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The detail, the colors, the lighting, the mood, everything fits!  It''s a great photo.</td>', 'Love this.  The detail, the colors, the lighting, the mood, everything fits!  It''s a great photo.', '2012-02-27 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693631, 1001149, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It makes you look.  It makes you wonder.  It''s mysterious and intriguing.  Great job</td>', 'I like this.  It makes you look.  It makes you wonder.  It''s mysterious and intriguing.  Great job', '2012-02-27 17:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693633, 1001072, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the choice of "characters" for this title.  It''s different and interesting.  It''s out of the box.  I think the colors should have been taken down a notch, but other than that, it''s great.</td>', 'Love the choice of "characters" for this title.  It''s different and interesting.  It''s out of the box.  I think the colors should have been taken down a notch, but other than that, it''s great.', '2012-02-27 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693635, 1001094, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is actually a movie my daughter suggested we see.  I like the picture, the close up.  And the horses mouth is so strange here... you would think that people would be turned away from this... but not me.  I actually find it interesting... telling.  The title and the image work together.</td>', 'This is actually a movie my daughter suggested we see.  I like the picture, the close up.  And the horses mouth is so strange here... you would think that people would be turned away from this... but not me.  I actually find it interesting... telling.  The title and the image work together.', '2012-02-27 17:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693636, 1000897, 134859, '<td valign="top">This was a terrific movie.  I like your choice of props for the image.  The only thing is that the back two seem to be a little tilted with regards to the rest.  If they were a bit straighter, I think the image would have been much better.  Great job overall.</td>', 'This was a terrific movie.  I like your choice of props for the image.  The only thing is that the back two seem to be a little tilted with regards to the rest.  If they were a bit straighter, I think the image would have been much better.  Great job overall.', '2012-02-27 17:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693638, 1000884, 134859, '<td valign="top">Never seen the movie.  The image works well.  I also like the vibrancy and noise in the photo.  Great choice.</td>', 'Never seen the movie.  The image works well.  I also like the vibrancy and noise in the photo.  Great choice.', '2012-02-27 17:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693639, 1001119, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love how the darkness "frames" the people in the streets, it''s an amazing shot.  The color conversion also works very well here.</td>', 'Love how the darkness "frames" the people in the streets, it''s an amazing shot.  The color conversion also works very well here.', '2012-02-27 17:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693640, 1000171, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, very different.  It probably won''t score too well, but I imagine that you used this because YOU liked it.  I almost missed the hand, I saw the blur, but almost missed it.  I like this.</td>', 'Very interesting, very different.  It probably won''t score too well, but I imagine that you used this because YOU liked it.  I almost missed the hand, I saw the blur, but almost missed it.  I like this.', '2012-02-27 17:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693641, 1000921, 134859, '<td valign="top">Very eerie shot.  Nice color choice.  GREAT angle.  It''s an amazing shot.  One of my favorites.  10</td>', 'Very eerie shot.  Nice color choice.  GREAT angle.  It''s an amazing shot.  One of my favorites.  10', '2012-02-27 17:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693642, 1001124, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I like it, but I would have liked to have seen it a bit more in focus.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I like it, but I would have liked to have seen it a bit more in focus.', '2012-02-27 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693644, 1001010, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s so different.  It''s unique.  I love it.  It''s almost like a painting, rather than a photograph, which makes it that much more interesting.</td>', 'It''s so different.  It''s unique.  I love it.  It''s almost like a painting, rather than a photograph, which makes it that much more interesting.', '2012-02-27 17:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693645, 1001030, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, very artistic.  Love the slight tilt.  Nice color choice.  Great detail and DOF.  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot, very artistic.  Love the slight tilt.  Nice color choice.  Great detail and DOF.  9', '2012-02-27 17:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693646, 1001103, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  makes one wonder.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  makes one wonder.', '2012-02-27 17:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693647, 1000598, 134859, '<td valign="top">Nice flight shot.  I like that you chose the downward winds, rather than them raised (as most people do).  It gives a different perspective.  The blurred trees are also a nice addition.</td>', 'Nice flight shot.  I like that you chose the downward winds, rather than them raised (as most people do).  It gives a different perspective.  The blurred trees are also a nice addition.', '2012-02-27 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693648, 1000831, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Love it.  Love it.  <br/>Detail is wonderful.  The clouds and sky and light are amazing.  AMAZING capture! 10</td>', 'Love it.  Love it.  Love it.  Detail is wonderful.  The clouds and sky and light are amazing.  AMAZING capture! 10', '2012-02-27 17:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693649, 1000782, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love the idea here.  The cards look old due to the coloring, the "thrown of the table" look works great.  And the Jack of Diamonds stands out.  Great shot.</td>', 'Love the idea here.  The cards look old due to the coloring, the "thrown of the table" look works great.  And the Jack of Diamonds stands out.  Great shot.', '2012-02-27 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693650, 1001151, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s different, that''s for sure.  There something that just isn''t there though.  I can''t think of what it is... perhaps its the lighting, or the sharpness, but something is making it clash for me.  Still, I like the idea, and the fact that it doesn''t look "overly professional" it has a "cavemanesque" to it.  8</td>', 'It''s different, that''s for sure.  There something that just isn''t there though.  I can''t think of what it is... perhaps its the lighting, or the sharpness, but something is making it clash for me.  Still, I like the idea, and the fact that it doesn''t look "overly professional" it has a "cavemanesque" to it.  8', '2012-02-27 17:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693651, 1000990, 134859, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  The image is just not standing out to me though.</td>', 'I like the idea here.  The image is just not standing out to me though.', '2012-02-27 17:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693653, 1001117, 134859, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The robe, the towel, the slippers with sock (yikes) and the red high-water sweat pants (double yikes)... <br/>all... well... amazingly work!<br/>I like it.  <br/>Nice colors, and he''s standing there like he''s in a stare down contest with the equipment.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The robe, the towel, the slippers with sock (yikes) and the red high-water sweat pants (double yikes)... all... well... amazingly work!I like it.  Nice colors, and he''s standing there like he''s in a stare down contest with the equipment.', '2012-02-27 17:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693654, 1000946, 134859, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  I love the lone woman walking down the street.  The color conversion was a nice choice.  The detail is there.  The contrast.  It''s beautiful.  8</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  I love the lone woman walking down the street.  The color conversion was a nice choice.  The detail is there.  The contrast.  It''s beautiful.  8', '2012-02-27 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693655, 1000494, 134859, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Something about it speaks to me.  I love that the lighting is to the back o the flower, rather than the front... it really works here.  There''s a feeling of "hope" in this picture.  9</td>', 'I love this.  Something about it speaks to me.  I love that the lighting is to the back o the flower, rather than the front... it really works here.  There''s a feeling of "hope" in this picture.  9', '2012-02-27 17:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6693657, 1000911, 134859, '<td valign="top">A very busy picture.  But it works with the title.  I would have liked to have seen the colors more vibrant or almost completely desaturated.  Overall, it''s nice.</td>', 'A very busy picture.  But it works with the title.  I would have liked to have seen the colors more vibrant or almost completely desaturated.  Overall, it''s nice.', '2012-02-27 17:25:07.000000', NULL, 1);
