(6693659, 1001111, 134859, '<td valign="top">Love this.  Gremlins was one of my favorite movies growing up, and Gizmo is awesome!  <br/>I love the simplicity here, and think it''s absolutely adorable.  The broccoli was a nice choice, as the green colors play well agains the rest</td>', 'Love this.  Gremlins was one of my favorite movies growing up, and Gizmo is awesome!  I love the simplicity here, and think it''s absolutely adorable.  The broccoli was a nice choice, as the green colors play well agains the rest', '2012-02-27 17:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
