(6693666, 1001059, 134859, '<td valign="top">Fits the title.  Like the color difference.  A nice porcelain tone to the skin.  I think it''s a bit over edited, in my opinion.</td>', 'Fits the title.  Like the color difference.  A nice porcelain tone to the skin.  I think it''s a bit over edited, in my opinion.', '2012-02-27 17:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
