(6693671, 1001147, 134859, '<td valign="top">The tint is a little cool for my liking, but I haven''t read the Hunger Games books, so I don''t know if they are supposed to be portrayed this way.  I also think the lighting shadows the side of her face a little too much.  But I like the composition and choice.</td>', 'The tint is a little cool for my liking, but I haven''t read the Hunger Games books, so I don''t know if they are supposed to be portrayed this way.  I also think the lighting shadows the side of her face a little too much.  But I like the composition and choice.', '2012-02-27 17:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
