(6693677, 1000673, 134859, '<td valign="top">It''s different.  It''s odd.  But I like it.  The contrast in the orange vs. blue works well.  It''s almost scary.</td>', 'It''s different.  It''s odd.  But I like it.  The contrast in the orange vs. blue works well.  It''s almost scary.', '2012-02-27 17:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
