(6700452, 1001117, 49018, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Giles_uk:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mcaldo:</b></div><hr/><i> Giles I am guessing :)<br/>Amusing, I like it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Nope Deere construction stuff isn''t over here, well most Deere construction stuff is rebranded hitachi so they''d be orange if it were me. We have the tractors though and I love my Deere :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hahahahah, Giles, that''s Sherlock Holmes mental, this level of tractor geekiness goes right over my head :)<br/>But, let''s admit it, you were a strong suspect :) Douglas Adams'' is English, you have a farm, the toys for the job and, after your freedom for the condemned image, nothing you can stage will ever surprise your dad any more :)<br/>And who would ever go out posing in his pyjama and towel in front of a digger, at risk of somebody calling the men in white, if it wasn''t his land?<br/>Now we know, a loving husband :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-05 08:37:43.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Giles_uk: Originally posted by mcaldo: Giles I am guessing :)Amusing, I like it.   Nope Deere construction stuff isn''t over here, well most Deere construction stuff is rebranded hitachi so they''d be orange if it were me. We have the tractors though and I love my Deere :)   Hahahahah, Giles, that''s Sherlock Holmes mental, this level of tractor geekiness goes right over my head :)But, let''s admit it, you were a strong suspect :) Douglas Adams'' is English, you have a farm, the toys for the job and, after your freedom for the condemned image, nothing you can stage will ever surprise your dad any more :)And who would ever go out posing in his pyjama and towel in front of a digger, at risk of somebody calling the men in white, if it wasn''t his land?Now we know, a loving husband :)', '2012-03-05 08:36:37.000000', '2012-03-05 08:37:43.000000', 0),
