(6700489, 1000885, 77196, '<td valign="top">Art - congrats on the top 10 finish, but this picture was a shocker for me. It is quite similar, but mirror image, to the church I grew up next door to - follow the link for a picture. I''d never seen another like it - until now.<br/><a href="//boundless.uoregon.edu/cdm4/item_viewer.php?CISOROOT=/archpnw&amp;CISOPTR=1833&amp;CISOBOX=1&amp;REC=2" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Calapooia Country Church, West of Sutherlin, OR off I-5</a> <br/>Even the interior is quite similar, with the wainscoting, etc. Now I am really curious as to which was first, or if they were done completely independently, and just happen to be similar. Thanks for sharing. Made my day...</td>', 'Art - congrats on the top 10 finish, but this picture was a shocker for me. It is quite similar, but mirror image, to the church I grew up next door to - follow the link for a picture. I''d never seen another like it - until now.Calapooia Country Church, West of Sutherlin, OR off I-5 Even the interior is quite similar, with the wainscoting, etc. Now I am really curious as to which was first, or if they were done completely independently, and just happen to be similar. Thanks for sharing. Made my day...', '2012-03-05 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
