ad any more :)And who would ever go out posing in his pyjama and towel in front of a digger, at risk of somebody calling the men in white, if it wasn''t his land?Now we know, a loving husband :)   haha! I''ve never had a discussion going on in my comment area before. I like it! :)', '2012-03-05 11:35:48.000000', NULL, 0),
